    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A one-line clarification sounds fine, but if we change the wording now, the other side's legal team is definitely going to see it and it'll trigger a fresh round of negotiations. That's exactly what we can't afford right now. \n\nBe real with me—if we leave it exactly as it is, what's the actual percentage chance this comes back to haunt us? If it's just a minor technicality that most people overlook, I'd rather just take the gamble and close on Friday. Is it truly a \"deal-breaker\" level risk, or are you just being extra careful?",
